<title>BRAZIL: Telerj Q1 net 30.631 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telerj Q1 net 30.631 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Telerj, unit of federally-owned Telebras serving Rio de Janeiro state, issued the following statement on its preliminary first quarter results.</p>
<p>				  Q1 1997</p>
<p>    Net profit		 30.631 million</p>
<p>    Gross oper revs	  432.939 million</p>
<p>    Net oper revs	    330.555 million</p>
<p>    Oper profit		 39.019 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. No comparative figures were provided.  </p>
<p>The company said fixed lines totaled 1.851 million, while cellular phones in use amounted to 168,000 in the period.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
